{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33140","headline":"早春日山居寄城郭知己 · 于武陵","name":"早春日山居寄城郭知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阳和潜发荡寒阴，便使川原景象新。\n入户风泉声沥沥，当轩云岫色沈沈。\n残云带雨轻飘雪，嫩柳含烟小绽金。\n虽有眼前诗酒兴，遨游争得称闲心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于武陵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}